  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC05_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "It's time for you to take your Oscillation Overthruster to the Four Falls Mill Statue on Triton Avenue. Rev it up and see what happens!",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Frog_Balestrom_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ProfHalstonBalestrom_QST_83.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38141,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC05_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Now that we've a fully-charged Oscillation Overthruster, it's time for you to activate it and bridge the wall between the planes of existence. This will create a portal through which you'll be able to contact your Storm Titan and learn how to summon one! \\n",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Frog_Balestrom_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ProfHalstonBalestrom_QST_84.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38141,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC05_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I'm sure it'll be perfectly safe, but just to be sure, please take that thing as far away from my classroom as possible!",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Frog_Balestrom_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ProfHalstonBalestrom_QST_85.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38141,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC05_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I'd recommend the Four Falls Mill Statue on Triton Avenue, near the Storm Mill... it seems as good a place as any. Try the little park close to the Triton statue. If anything goes wrong, the Storm Mill should be able to attract any stray lightning bolts!",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Frog_Balestrom_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ProfHalstonBalestrom_QST_86.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38141,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC05_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Good news, then? Excellent! The Storm Lord will certainly be on the lookout for your call. Here's the spell to get his attention whenever you need him.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Frog_Balestrom_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ProfHalstonBalestrom_QST_87.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38141,
